cebida para atender você e sua família, então agende sua visita com nossos especialistas e encante-se!\n\nViva no Santa Cândida! Viva no Vivendas do Bosque\nCondomínio horizontal com uma infraestrutura completa que dispõe de portaria 24 horas, piscina externa, 2 salões de festas, quadra poliesportiva, quadras de areia, playgrounds, brinquedoteca, sala de jogos, quiosques com churrasqueira, academia ao ar livre,  estacionamento para visitantes.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2daf9f5f-bac9-4a9c-bb95-3d0a4d936f4d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/60b1c9dc-594d-4af6-9915-6d4b217f14cb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f61782ba-b890-483e-aff9-1a408f2742e3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/16235381-9d1e-414e-a059-f3cc5eac2a6c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/20e8b378-ae69-4547-9f80-fb39e60c1b47.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3a7516a5-f29b-4017-8242-cb20bee1f691.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/df4789bc-4ed2-4668-8e65-0e172f6fb615.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ba36e853-900f-437f-b613-ed59921516d3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3dc56d97-049c-4146-8b3c-6a69e8f0c929.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6920c2fbeb06e9eb5a268f97/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f2cc3eed-781c-40da-a850-8298f07c653b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/